    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 30.</p><p><strong>Escape Artist.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can take the &amp;Reference[Disengage] action, which also ends the Grappled condition on you.</p><p><strong>Quickness.</strong> Your Speed increases by 30 feet.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-BTieKWSqXALMO8oH\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feat includes an Active Effect which automatically increases your Speed.</p></section>",
